  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "On San Cha Mountain, Chou Jiu offers Fang Yuan knowledge of this door to preserve his life. Fang Yuan recalls that after Verdant Great Sun died, Ren Zu went there to attempt a revival, and that legend says full comprehension of the secrets behind the door would let a person control life and death. The interior is extremely wide and reflects the five regions of the main world, with unique natural Gu such as life Gu and death Gu.",
      "chapters": [
        384
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_san_cha_mountain",
        "char_chou_jiu",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_verdant_great_sun",
        "char_ren_zu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Chou Jiu says he has explored it many times, captured life Gu and death Gu, refined one life one death Gu, and left that Gu inside the door so death energy from people he kills converts into lifeforce for his healing methods. He names Shadow Sect’s founding ancestor as a rank eight Gu Immortal of the Immemorial Era who found the door and placed it into his blessed land.",
      "chapters": [
        384
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_shadow_sect",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "evt_era_immemorial"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The interior is extremely wide and reflects the five regions of the main world.",
      "chapters": [
        384
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "In the depths of the immortal graveyard it stands as a tall pitch-black door, with an aura of eeriness, deathly silence, terror, and power.",
      "chapters": [
        2192
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "door-form",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Deviation (recorded): this page uses the Southern Border region field because Chou Jiu bargains over the door while tied to Shadow Sect on San Cha Mountain. Chapter 384 seats the door inside Shadow Sect’s blessed land, not as a main-world five-region map pin.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "door-form",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_southern_border",
        "loc_shadow_sect_blessed_land"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Chou Jiu says he and his senior sister Chen Jiu cultivated together and entered deep into the Door of Life and Death to capture life Gu and death Gu.",
      "chapters": [
        385
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "chou-jius-entry",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "A Legends of Ren Zu excerpt states that the door had two routes, a road of life and a road of death, and that either one was thick with suffering Gu. Before Red Lotus Demon Venerable broke fate Gu, the souls of the world were sucked directly into the door, and once it was broken they no longer were, which is how zombies were born.",
      "chapters": [
        722
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "roads-of-life-and-death",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_the_legends_of_ren_zu",
        "gu_suffering_gu",
        "char_red_lotus_demon_venerable",
        "gu_fate_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In Southern Border, narration calls Shadow Sect’s base Life and death blessed land, and says that land contained the Door of Life and Death, with a dream realm in front of the door.",
      "chapters": [
        984
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "life-and-death-blessed-land",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan states that the Door of Life and Death is inside Shadow Sect’s blessed land, and that Shadow Sect’s blessed land is at Southern Border’s Yi Tian Mountain, then engulfed by a giant dream realm.",
      "chapters": [
        1092
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "yi-tian-mountain-seat",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_yi_tian_mountain"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Inside Shadow Sect’s blessed land, the door of life and death holds countless soul beasts, and they are all mobilized at massive scale to attack Duke Long.",
      "chapters": [
        1368
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "soul-beasts-within",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_duke_long"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "More than a hundred thousand years earlier, seven people emerge from the door of life and death, and in that year Shadow Sect is established with its first generation split souls known as Red, Orange, Yellow, Green, Azure, Blue and Purple.",
      "chapters": [
        1371
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "first-split-souls-emerge",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_yellow",
        "char_green"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The door is a secluded domain of heaven and earth that has existed since the world’s creation, where the souls of all who died would come to reside.",
      "chapters": [
        1373
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "ancient-domain-of-the-dead",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
